# AI Video Generator App

This project creates short AI-style marketing videos from a prompt using FastAPI and local generation tools.

## Features
- Arabic/English web interface
- Prompt-based video generation
- Duration and visual style selection
- Output as a downloadable MP4
- Easy to extend with OpenAI / Replicate / Runway APIs

## Run locally

```bash
cd Backend/AI_Video_Generator
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate  # Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
python app.py
```

Then open:

http://127.0.0.1:8000

## Notes
- `ffmpeg` must be installed on the machine.
- The app uses `gTTS` for voiceover and `moviepy` to render video scenes.
- This is a local demo version designed to work without any API keys.

## Example prompt

> "منتج جديد في مجال الذكاء الاصطناعي. شرح المزايا، التحديثات، والسرعة في الاستخدام."
